Package: AirEcuador
Type: Package
Title: Import Air Quality and Meteorological Data from Ecuador
Version: 0.3.0.9001
Authors@R: person("Fidel", "Vallejo", email = "fidel.vallejo@unach.edu.ec", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Import air quality and meteorological observations from Quito's
    Environment Secretariat <https://datosambiente.quito.gob.ec/> and Cuenca's
    EMOV CAIRE network <https://caire.emov.gob.ec/datosAutomaticas>. Import
    air pollutant observations from Cuenca's Universidad del Azuay station
    through IERSE <https://ierse.uazuay.edu.ec/aire/>. Station names, missing
    values, date intervals and optional
    percentile filters are handled consistently. Minute observations from
    Cuenca can be aggregated to hourly means with an explicit completeness
    requirement. Reference monitoring station locations in Quito and Cuenca
    can be displayed on interactive maps.
